<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 5.47 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 5.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped to 5.47 percent on Thursday from 6.25 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in twenty reported transactions with a total value of 30.35 million dinars ($42.3 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
